/********************************************************
 * Avaritia - chest_screen.json (UtilityCraft-compatible)
 *
 * This file NO LONGER copies the vanilla chest_screen.json.
 * It only:
 *   1) defines the NEW controls (ec_*, nc_*, comp_*, rf_*)
 *   2) uses "modifications" to insert conditions into
 *      small_chest_screen  -> so other addons (UtilityCraft...)
 *      can stack on top of each other without overwriting.
 ********************************************************/
